  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2.3. Increased capacity of the ILO constituents to engage in a forward-looking international labour standards policy</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Office received all due article 22 reports on all ratified Conventions within the deadline. In a follow-up to a workshop on reporting delivered in September 2019, a number of clarifications and exchanges were provided by the Office to the Ministry&apos;s officials in 2020 and in 2021 concerning the reporting schedule and the relevant report forms on the different ratified Conventions</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">2.3.1. Percentage of reports on the application of ratified Conventions due by 1 September received in a timely manner that include replies to comments of the supervisory bodies</narrative>
    </title>
